WEBVTT

00:00:12.708 --> 00:00:14.542
Are you feeling better now?

00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:17.833
Y-Yes! Thank you so much!

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:19.375
Mikono?!

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.083
Mikono is at the tower!

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:26.625
Mikono!

00:00:28.208 --> 00:00:30.375
Calling all Elements.

00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:33.750
We've detected an Abductor
in the Neo Kowloon area.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.708
Hence, the training has been discontinued.

00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:41.542
Cayenne, Zessica and Andy.
Return to the academy immediately.

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:48.292
My good friend, leave things here
to me and go back to the academy.

00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:49.875
You too, Sazanka.

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:52.458
But Mikono is in danger!

00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:56.875
You're an Element, and yet you put
your sister first before your duty?

00:01:00.917 --> 00:01:02.792
Ah, wait for me!

00:01:05.917 --> 00:01:07.917
I envy you guys...

00:01:09.583 --> 00:01:14.500
A Gattai more sublime than anyone's,
and more beautiful than anyone's...

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:18.250
I can achieve that, and yet...

00:01:21.375 --> 00:01:22.875
<i>Reverence!</i>

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:26.917
<i>Living your life don't give up now</i>
<i>keep moving on</i>

00:01:26.917 --> 00:01:32.542
<i>I'll hold you over and over and over again</i>

00:01:32.542 --> 00:01:38.375
<i>I'll probably meet you tomorrow</i>

00:01:38.375 --> 00:01:44.083
<i>Relying on the dim starlight</i>

00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:50.167
<i>I'll recognize you, I know I will</i>

00:01:50.167 --> 00:02:00.125
<i>After a hundred eons, the two of us</i>
<i>will open the door of legend</i>

00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:06.000
<i>Leaping over the blue abyss</i>

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.792
<i>in order to live and die together with you</i>

00:02:11.792 --> 00:02:22.708
<i>I journeyed through many reincarnations</i>
<i>with sadness in my heart</i>

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:25.750
<i>I'm at my full power and yet still incomplete</i>

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.625
<i>Being by your side</i>

00:02:28.625 --> 00:02:34.417
<i>brings warmth to my cold heart and with it, pain</i>

00:02:34.417 --> 00:02:37.500
<i>But I'll always be by your side</i>

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.375
<i>I'll always stay close to you</i>

00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:45.042
<i>The two of us will board the ship of light</i>

00:02:45.042 --> 00:02:50.833
<i>Let's play the wind's opening chords (Awaken!)</i>

00:02:56.708 --> 00:02:58.250
I found you!

00:03:05.375 --> 00:03:07.083
--You stink.
--What?

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.875
You stink and taste sweet.

00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:15.917
Mikono!

00:03:15.917 --> 00:03:16.958
"Out of control"

00:03:17.208 --> 00:03:18.833
This reaction is...

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:21.292
It's not a romance. This is...

00:03:23.042 --> 00:03:25.208
...a forbidden encounter.

00:03:25.708 --> 00:03:29.542
"Agitato of Life"

00:03:33.708 --> 00:03:35.208
Mikono!

00:03:40.667 --> 00:03:44.250
Oh? She's quite fragile.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.375
Let go of Mikono!

00:03:52.167 --> 00:03:54.250
What happened to your smell?

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:58.667
I don't smell anything from you.

00:03:58.667 --> 00:04:00.875
A strange man with no smell...

00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:03.958
Say...

00:04:05.417 --> 00:04:08.375
...do you mind if I kill you?

00:04:09.792 --> 00:04:12.958
I'd rather not be killed.

00:04:12.958 --> 00:04:16.583
Oh... I see...

00:04:16.583 --> 00:04:19.458
H-Hey! Hold it!

00:04:19.458 --> 00:04:22.250
Don't stand in our way.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.417
This is... my damn woman.

00:04:35.458 --> 00:04:38.292
Y-You're wrong.

00:04:38.292 --> 00:04:41.167
I won't let you...

00:04:42.917 --> 00:04:44.958
I won't let you have Mikono!

00:04:50.125 --> 00:04:51.625
You son of a bitch!

00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:17.208
Wings...!

00:05:24.167 --> 00:05:25.833
What's this noise?!

00:05:41.208 --> 00:05:44.417
So Kagura went to Vega again...

00:05:44.417 --> 00:05:47.708
Who on earth opened the gate?

00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:51.042
I thought Kagura's Gnis was locked down.

00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:55.375
It's been a while, Izumo.

00:05:57.542 --> 00:05:59.583
You've grown, too, Jin.

00:06:01.708 --> 00:06:03.333
Mykage!

00:06:03.333 --> 00:06:05.875
So you <i>were </i>the one behind this.

00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:07.625
When did you awaken?

00:06:07.625 --> 00:06:09.625
When?

00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:12.583
I was given an awakening kiss...

00:06:12.583 --> 00:06:16.000
...by the Mechanical Angel's
forbidden technique.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.583
Why did you help Kagura?

00:06:18.583 --> 00:06:21.500
All I did was see him off...

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:27.208
Him, the chosen one who started
running towards the new world of love.

00:06:27.208 --> 00:06:29.417
"New world of love"?

00:06:30.417 --> 00:06:33.958
When the Mechanical Angel
used the forbidden technique,

00:06:33.958 --> 00:06:39.625
there was a Rare Igura in it.
Kagura was drawn by her.

00:06:39.625 --> 00:06:45.000
Aren't you curious about this
Rare Igura he pursues so avidly?

00:06:47.667 --> 00:06:54.125
If this Rare Igura can operate
the Mechanical Angel, she might...

00:06:54.125 --> 00:06:58.542
...be able to become the true Eve of Altair.

00:07:03.917 --> 00:07:06.500
Continue to monitor Vega.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:11.250
If something irregular happens,
we'll forcibly collect Mithra Gnis.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:12.750
Roger.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.583
Alicia...

00:08:02.958 --> 00:08:06.292
Hey... do you mind if I kill you?

00:08:06.292 --> 00:08:08.875
Fine by me...

00:08:08.875 --> 00:08:11.333
...as long as you can play my sound...

00:08:21.833 --> 00:08:25.500
You... smell a bit.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.875
It's a similar smell to that woman's.

00:08:34.458 --> 00:08:35.958
Dammit!

00:08:47.458 --> 00:08:49.458
Your sounds are quite good.

00:08:51.583 --> 00:08:55.000
So Shrade remained in the Neo Kowloon area...

00:08:55.000 --> 00:09:00.708
Okay. As soon as Cayenne, Zessica,
and Andy are back, we'll send them in.

00:09:00.708 --> 00:09:02.208
Roger.

00:09:03.458 --> 00:09:07.250
Excuse me... I've been
wondering this for a while now...

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:10.917
...but why doesn't Shrade
participate in real battles?

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:19.167
Well, he always scores the best in battle sims...

00:09:19.167 --> 00:09:22.042
...so we girls wonder why.

00:09:22.042 --> 00:09:24.500
There's no barrier between
boys and girls anymore.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:29.208
We'd like to know the profile of the Elements
whom we might merge with in the future.

00:09:37.167 --> 00:09:42.542
Shrade Elan has been talented
in music since early childhood.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:51.667
But the sounds of his piano contained
a strong negative Element power.

00:10:05.125 --> 00:10:08.917
The sounds produced by Shrade directly
touched people's subconscious

00:10:08.917 --> 00:10:10.667
and amplified their pains...

00:10:10.667 --> 00:10:16.042
The rumor about him spread and soon
he became an instrument of darkness.

00:10:45.625 --> 00:10:47.167
What's this sound?!

00:11:05.583 --> 00:11:07.333
Neo-DEAVA...

00:11:10.583 --> 00:11:14.708
Shrade was scouted by that kid Director?!

00:11:14.708 --> 00:11:17.542
Actually, how old is the Director?

00:11:17.542 --> 00:11:24.625
But the Element aptitude test revealed
that Shrade had a serious problem.

00:11:24.625 --> 00:11:26.000
What?

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:30.708
Piloting Aquarion shortens his life.

00:11:31.833 --> 00:11:36.375
Aquarion amplifies an Element's hidden power.

00:11:36.375 --> 00:11:42.375
And the Elements bounce it back
and they elevate each other's power.

00:11:42.375 --> 00:11:45.667
Shrade's Element power is too strong.

00:11:45.667 --> 00:11:50.750
His delicate body can't bear the
power amplification of Aquarion.

00:11:52.083 --> 00:11:53.375
Someone jumped off?!

00:11:53.375 --> 00:11:55.542
I'm sorry.

00:11:55.542 --> 00:11:57.833
It got a bit bent.

00:12:00.083 --> 00:12:02.375
But it produces good sound.

00:12:04.583 --> 00:12:07.958
It's the sound that gives me ecstatic death.

00:12:22.542 --> 00:12:24.625
Mikono!

00:12:24.625 --> 00:12:28.167
Forgive... me...

00:12:28.167 --> 00:12:34.583
I have to... apologize... to him.

00:12:34.583 --> 00:12:37.167
Apologize... to him?!

00:12:37.167 --> 00:12:38.958
What do you mean, Mikono?!

00:12:40.667 --> 00:12:42.375
An Abductor alarm?!

00:12:46.417 --> 00:12:47.958
Vector machines!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:58.542
Everyone gets in our way... How dare they?!

00:12:58.542 --> 00:13:00.625
My damn woman...!

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:04.667
Where are you?!

00:13:29.792 --> 00:13:31.750
That's...

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:35.000
It's that beast-like Abductor from before!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.333
It's Mithra Gnis.

00:13:36.333 --> 00:13:37.583
What?

00:13:37.583 --> 00:13:40.333
Is that the name of that machine,
Supreme Commander?

00:13:48.042 --> 00:13:51.250
Being inside this, I should
be able to smell better.

00:14:00.042 --> 00:14:01.542
Cayenne!

00:14:04.542 --> 00:14:06.042
This isn't her!

00:14:11.917 --> 00:14:13.625
Then would it be this one?!

00:14:14.875 --> 00:14:16.375
Dodge it, Zessica!

00:14:28.583 --> 00:14:30.417
I can tell...

00:14:30.417 --> 00:14:32.750
He's looking for Mikono.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.500
Mikono!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.542
You came to?

00:14:38.542 --> 00:14:40.792
Amata...

00:14:40.792 --> 00:14:43.208
What...? I...

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.292
Mikono...

00:14:46.292 --> 00:14:49.375
You said you had to apologize to him earlier.

00:14:49.375 --> 00:14:51.458
What? Apologize?

00:14:53.083 --> 00:15:00.750
I don't know... But when he
grabbed me, I was scared.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:05.250
But his hot breathing...

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:08.208
It somehow made me feel nostalgic.

00:15:19.333 --> 00:15:21.417
No! I can't shake him off!

00:15:38.833 --> 00:15:43.000
There you are... my damn woman!

00:16:01.417 --> 00:16:03.750
Are you okay, my good friend?

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.333
Shrade!

00:16:10.167 --> 00:16:12.333
I'll take your place.

00:16:12.333 --> 00:16:15.042
But your body...!

00:16:25.292 --> 00:16:28.792
Hand over... my damn woman!

00:16:30.375 --> 00:16:32.208
Mikono!

00:16:32.208 --> 00:16:33.208
That guy...!

00:16:33.208 --> 00:16:35.750
Don't worry about me! Amata!

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:38.042
--Me too!
--Huh?

00:16:38.042 --> 00:16:41.250
I feel like I know him, too.

00:16:43.875 --> 00:16:48.000
I feel like he's the last person
I could hand you over to!

00:16:55.375 --> 00:16:58.417
--Cayenne?!
--No, it's not him! Don't tell me...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.292
Shrade!

00:17:01.292 --> 00:17:03.292
Why is he in a Vector machine?!

00:17:08.375 --> 00:17:10.375
You shouldn't! You are...!

00:17:10.375 --> 00:17:12.958
We're not dealing with weaklings here.

00:17:12.958 --> 00:17:15.083
We have no choice but for me to fight here!

00:17:15.083 --> 00:17:17.792
But your body...

00:17:17.792 --> 00:17:19.167
Fudo...

00:17:19.167 --> 00:17:22.792
Element change! Eject Andy W. Hall!

00:17:22.792 --> 00:17:24.458
--What?!
--What?!

00:17:24.458 --> 00:17:27.208
I thought I'd finally be able
to merge with a girl this--!

00:17:32.375 --> 00:17:34.958
Come on, you damn woman!

00:17:38.083 --> 00:17:39.917
What the hell?!

00:17:39.917 --> 00:17:41.417
Vector Z!

00:17:44.167 --> 00:17:45.750
Mikono, run!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.500
Amata!

00:18:00.208 --> 00:18:02.542
Director Crea, please give
us permission to merge.

00:18:02.542 --> 00:18:04.750
Shrade! No!

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:07.458
I don't care if I die.

00:18:07.458 --> 00:18:10.583
If I can't play Aquarion,

00:18:10.583 --> 00:18:13.250
it's as if I'm already dead anyway!

00:18:31.667 --> 00:18:33.625
Gattai permission granted!

00:18:33.625 --> 00:18:36.833
Shrade Elan, you'll be the head!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:44.167
So the time has finally come...

00:18:44.167 --> 00:18:48.000
The time I can play Aquarion!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.917
Senritsu Gattai!

00:18:49.917 --> 00:18:52.375
Go! Aquarion!

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:07.833
What a powerful sound! It echoes
to the very recesses of my heart!

00:19:07.833 --> 00:19:10.750
But for some reason, it makes me feel nostalgic!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:13.333
This is the sound of life!

00:19:13.333 --> 00:19:16.208
It's the first cry of a pure and innocent baby!

00:19:21.333 --> 00:19:23.542
Aquarion Spada!

00:19:25.083 --> 00:19:27.958
The Gattai with Vector Y being the head...

00:19:27.958 --> 00:19:29.708
Aquarion Spada!

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:38.250
With Shrade's power, a new
form of power has been born.

00:19:44.875 --> 00:19:46.500
Aquarion...

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:51.375
The moment I saw it for the first time,

00:19:51.375 --> 00:19:57.708
the dead heart inside me began
to beat in violent staccato.

00:19:57.708 --> 00:20:00.750
That's right. It's...

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:02.958
...the melody of the soul!

00:20:05.917 --> 00:20:09.875
You damn Mechanical Angel! I'm not
gonna let you get in my way again!

00:20:09.875 --> 00:20:12.083
Amata! Zessica!

00:20:12.083 --> 00:20:16.000
Life is a rhythm!

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.792
Play the rhythm of your life and send it to me!

00:20:18.792 --> 00:20:22.875
Please help me out! Let me
play the rhythm of my life!

00:20:22.875 --> 00:20:24.042
Got it!

00:20:24.042 --> 00:20:26.375
I can't let him be, either!

00:20:30.792 --> 00:20:34.083
Here we go! Arpeggio of the soul!

00:20:41.375 --> 00:20:43.250
You bastard!

00:20:45.875 --> 00:20:48.625
Amata's Element power, flight!

00:20:48.625 --> 00:20:51.208
And Zessica's impact...

00:20:51.208 --> 00:20:55.167
When those two powers are
combined with Shrade's power...

00:20:55.167 --> 00:20:57.292
If the moon reflected on the water

00:20:57.292 --> 00:21:00.208
makes the vibrato of the moon
in the sky allegro vivace...

00:21:00.208 --> 00:21:01.458
What?!

00:21:01.458 --> 00:21:05.833
...the moon that lives inside of
people will sing their lives agitato!

00:21:07.083 --> 00:21:09.167
Moonlight Requiem!

00:21:14.417 --> 00:21:15.917
How dare you...?!

00:21:36.833 --> 00:21:38.833
D-Did he do it?

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:46.208
Not yet...! I can still fight!

00:21:48.333 --> 00:21:52.417
Sorry, but I'm gonna collect Mithra Gnis.

00:21:52.417 --> 00:21:55.583
Don't go doing things on your own
while we're investigating Vega,

00:21:55.583 --> 00:21:57.333
as it creates more work for me.

00:21:57.333 --> 00:21:59.125
Jin...!

00:21:59.125 --> 00:22:00.667
You son of a bitch...!

00:22:05.042 --> 00:22:06.958
Is he running away?!

00:22:06.958 --> 00:22:09.708
Shrade! Go attack more!

00:22:10.708 --> 00:22:12.167
Shrade?!

00:22:12.167 --> 00:22:13.917
Hey, Shrade is...

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:18.500
Shrade! Are you okay?!

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:20.958
--Shrade!
--Shrade!

00:22:27.708 --> 00:22:31.500
Mikono... What's the matter, Mikono?

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:35.417
I don't know... I don't know...

00:22:35.417 --> 00:22:40.250
But... not knowing hurts...

00:22:52.583 --> 00:22:58.042
<i>It wasn't stolen away by the wind</i>

00:22:58.042 --> 00:23:00.917
<i>With the resolve that we cannot turn back,</i>

00:23:00.917 --> 00:23:08.708
<i>we accept the tragedy</i>

00:23:08.708 --> 00:23:13.417
<i>A cavern lies where my heart once was</i>

00:23:13.417 --> 00:23:16.000
<i>If I was older,</i>

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:21.667
<i>would I have been able</i>
<i>to save you and the future?</i>

00:23:21.667 --> 00:23:29.000
<i>Having only a single means</i>
<i>to protect the one you love,</i>

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:35.833
<i>you become lost and drift in the sky</i>

00:23:35.833 --> 00:23:43.542
<i>I'll never be able to meet anyone</i>
<i>who means more to me than you</i>

00:23:43.542 --> 00:23:50.000
<i>A long flare that struggles against the moon</i>

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:56.542
<i>A story that ends even before it begins</i>

00:23:56.542 --> 00:24:02.500
<i>A melody that seals away</i>
<i>the vulnerable tenderness</i>

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.542
<i>The more I play it, the more I sing it...</i>

00:24:05.542 --> 00:24:11.042
<i>It almost destroys me how much...</i>

00:24:11.042 --> 00:24:17.958
<i>...I long for you</i>

00:24:20.042 --> 00:24:23.333
Do you know the horror story
about the Element who disappeared?

00:24:23.333 --> 00:24:26.542
It's bad. It's scary. You won't be
able to go to the bathroom at night.

00:24:26.542 --> 00:24:29.583
Shall I dig a hole just in case?

00:24:30.208 --> 00:24:31.750
"Next Episode 'Midnight Girl'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:31.750 --> 00:24:33.250
"Next Episode 'Midnight Girl'"
"Midnight Girl."
